	(uuid "fe059ab3-394c-5b9d-9bdf-2a49465d6b84")
	(at 155.4 33)
	(descr "JST PH B6B-PH-SM4-TB: 6-way, 2.0 mm pitch, top entry (upright), surface mount, 2 A / 100 V. Land pattern from KiCad's Connector_JST library (JST manufacturer drawing), mirrored in X for back-side mounting (pin 1 at +5 seen from the front). The mouth faces away from the board; the wires leave straight up. The solder tails run 2.5 mm out of the body towards +Y. MP pads are the retention tabs and carry the mechanical load - the signal pads do not.")
